---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch. LPs, founders, media and research. Direct email, no forms."
>
  <section class="contact container-narrow">
    <header class="contact__head">
      <p class="kicker">Contact</p>
      <h1 class="contact__title gavel-drop">Get in touch.</h1>
      <p class="contact__sub">Direct email. The first message lands with the GP.</p>
    </header>

    <article id="lps" class="contact__block clamp">
      <p class="kicker contact__when">If you allocate capital</p>
      <h2 class="contact__h2 gavel-drop"><a href="/lps/">LPs →</a></h2>
      <p>
        Family offices, allocators, and institutions evaluating Fund I. Send a few lines on the fund or office, the mandate, and what you have already read. The IM is available on request.
      </p>
      <p class="contact__email"><a href="mailto:wt@hmm.ventures">wt@hmm.ventures</a></p>
    </article>

    <article id="founders" class="contact__block clamp">
      <p class="kicker contact__when">If you are building in a regulated market</p>
      <h2 class="contact__h2 gavel-drop"><a href="/founders/">Founders →</a></h2>
      <p>
        Send a one-pager or a deck. Tell us which regulator your demand curve depends on, the published timeline you are tracking, and the cheque you are looking for.
      </p>
      <p class="contact__email"><a href="mailto:wt@hmm.ventures">wt@hmm.ventures</a></p>
    </article>

    <footer class="contact__trust">
      <p class="kicker">hmm Ventures</p>
      <p class="contact__addr">DIFC, Dubai. Track A self-managed VCFM.</p>
      <p class="contact__tag">Necessity is the thesis.</p>
    </footer>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .contact { padding-block: var(--s-8) var(--s-9); }
  .contact__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    margin-block-end: var(--s-7);
    padding-block-end: var(--s-5);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .contact__title {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    line-height: var(--lh-tight);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact__sub {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact__block {
    padding-block: var(--s-6) var(--s-7);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    scroll-margin-top: var(--s-7);
  }
  .contact__when { color: var(--c-tomato); margin: 0; }
  .contact__h2 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    line-height: var(--lh-tight);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact__h2 a {
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--mo-tick) var(--ease-golden);
  }
  .contact__h2 a:hover { color: var(--c-tomato); }
  .contact__email {
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact__email a {
    color: var(--c-tomato);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .contact__email a:hover { color: var(--fg); }
  .contact__note { color: var(--fg-soft); margin: 0; }
  .contact__trust {
    margin-block-start: var(--s-7);
    padding-block: var(--s-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-2);
  }
  .contact__addr {
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .contact__tag {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    color: var(--c-tomato);
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
